{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"pnpm add @tanstack/charts vue","lang":"sh"},{"type":"code","value":"<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { defineChart } from '@tanstack/charts'\nimport { tooltip } from '@tanstack/charts/tooltip'\nimport { computed } from 'vue'\nimport { Chart } from '@tanstack/charts/vue'\n\nconst definition = computed(() =>\n  defineChart(createRevenueChart(rows.value), { tooltip }),\n)\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <Chart\n    :definition=\"definition\"\n    aria-label=\"Revenue by month\"\n    :aspect-ratio=\"16 / 9\"\n    @focus-change=\"focused = $event\"\n  />\n</template>","lang":"vue"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Vue prop updates call the shared host after each component update. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"class"},{"type":"text","value":" and\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"style"},{"type":"text","value":" target the outer host. Vue SSR renders the initial SVG."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"lifecycle","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Lifecycle"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The component prerenders through one shared adapter controller, mounts it in\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onMounted"},{"type":"text","value":", forwards the latest complete props in "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onUpdated"},{"type":"text","value":", and destroys it\nin "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onBeforeUnmount"},{"type":"text","value":". Keep stable definitions at module scope. Use "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"computed"},{"type":"text","value":"\nfor definitions that capture reactive values."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"ssr-and-hydration","children":[{"type":"text","value":"SSR and hydration"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Vue SSR emits the complete "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".ts-chart-host"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".ts-chart-surface"},{"type":"text","value":", and\naccessible SVG. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"initialWidth"},{"type":"text","value":" controls responsive server geometry. Vue's\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useId()"},{"type":"text","value":" provides a stable generated resource prefix when server and browser\nrender the same tree. Keep definitions, formatters, and dimensions\ndeterministic."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"presentation-and-rendering","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Presentation and rendering"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"class"},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"style: StyleValue"},{"type":"text","value":" apply to the outer host. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"className"},{"type":"text","value":" applies to\nthe rendered chart surface. The component disables general attribute\ninheritance; unrelated attributes are not forwarded. It starts with SVG and\ncan compose marks that use "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"canvasChartRenderer"},{"type":"text","value":". Use "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"renderSvg"},{"type":"text","value":" to replace\nSVG serialization without replacing the shared host."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Exports: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Chart"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChartCommonProps"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChartPresentationProps"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChartProps"},{"type":"text","value":",\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChartTooltipBodySlotContext"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChartDefinition"},{"type":"text","value":", and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChartPoint"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"tooltip-body-composition","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Tooltip body composition"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"#tooltipBody"},{"type":"text","value":" scoped slot for Vue-owned content. Render\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"<component :is=\"defaultBody\" />"},{"type":"text","value":" to retain native rows and swatches. The\nshared host owns focus, placement, portaling, inert transient state, pinning,\nand dismissal; Vue owns the slot lifecycle inside the body target."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See the "},{"type":"link","href":"./reference/chart.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Chart"},{"type":"text","value":" reference"}]},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"link","href":"../../guides/ssr-and-hydration.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"SSR and hydration"}]},{"type":"text","value":",\nand "},{"type":"link","href":"../../reference/chart-definitions.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Chart Definition API"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"lifecycle","text":"Lifecycle","level":2},{"id":"ssr-and-hydration","text":"SSR and hydration","level":2},{"id":"presentation-and-rendering","text":"Presentation and rendering","level":2},{"id":"tooltip-body-composition","text":"Tooltip body composition","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```sh\npnpm add @tanstack/charts vue\n```\n\n```vue\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { defineChart } from '@tanstack/charts'\nimport { tooltip } from '@tanstack/charts/tooltip'\nimport { computed } from 'vue'\nimport { Chart } from '@tanstack/charts/vue'\n\nconst definition = computed(() =>\n  defineChart(createRevenueChart(rows.value), { tooltip }),\n)\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <Chart\n    :definition=\"definition\"\n    aria-label=\"Revenue by month\"\n    :aspect-ratio=\"16 / 9\"\n    @focus-change=\"focused = $event\"\n  />\n</template>\n```\n\nVue prop updates call the shared host after each component update. `class` and\n`style` target the outer host. Vue SSR renders the initial SVG.\n\n## Lifecycle\n\nThe component prerenders through one shared adapter controller, mounts it in\n`onMounted`, forwards the latest complete props in `onUpdated`, and destroys it\nin `onBeforeUnmount`. Keep stable definitions at module scope. Use `computed`\nfor definitions that capture reactive values.\n\n## SSR and hydration\n\nVue SSR emits the complete `.ts-chart-host`, `.ts-chart-surface`, and\naccessible SVG. `initialWidth` controls responsive server geometry. Vue's\n`useId()` provides a stable generated resource prefix when server and browser\nrender the same tree. Keep definitions, formatters, and dimensions\ndeterministic.\n\n## Presentation and rendering\n\n`class` and `style: StyleValue` apply to the outer host. `className` applies to\nthe rendered chart surface. The component disables general attribute\ninheritance; unrelated attributes are not forwarded. It starts with SVG and\ncan compose marks that use `canvasChartRenderer`. Use `renderSvg` to replace\nSVG serialization without replacing the shared host.\n\nExports: `Chart`, `ChartCommonProps`, `ChartPresentationProps`, `ChartProps`,\n`ChartTooltipBodySlotContext`, `ChartDefinition`, and `ChartPoint`.\n\n## Tooltip body composition\n\nUse the `#tooltipBody` scoped slot for Vue-owned content. Render\n`<component :is=\"defaultBody\" />` to retain native rows and swatches. The\nshared host owns focus, placement, portaling, inert transient state, pinning,\nand dismissal; Vue owns the slot lifecycle inside the body target.\n\nSee the [`Chart` reference](./reference/chart.md), [SSR and hydration](../../guides/ssr-and-hydration.md),\nand [Chart Definition API](../../reference/chart-definitions.md).\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Vue Adapter\ndescription: Render and hydrate TanStack Charts with Vue 3.\n---\n\n```sh\npnpm add @tanstack/charts vue\n```\n\n```vue\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { defineChart } from '@tanstack/charts'\nimport { tooltip } from '@tanstack/charts/tooltip'\nimport { computed } from 'vue'\nimport { Chart } from '@tanstack/charts/vue'\n\nconst definition = computed(() =>\n  defineChart(createRevenueChart(rows.value), { tooltip }),\n)\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <Chart\n    :definition=\"definition\"\n    aria-label=\"Revenue by month\"\n    :aspect-ratio=\"16 / 9\"\n    @focus-change=\"focused = $event\"\n  />\n</template>\n```\n\nVue prop updates call the shared host after each component update. `class` and\n`style` target the outer host. Vue SSR renders the initial SVG.\n\n## Lifecycle\n\nThe component prerenders through one shared adapter controller, mounts it in\n`onMounted`, forwards the latest complete props in `onUpdated`, and destroys it\nin `onBeforeUnmount`. Keep stable definitions at module scope. Use `computed`\nfor definitions that capture reactive values.\n\n## SSR and hydration\n\nVue SSR emits the complete `.ts-chart-host`, `.ts-chart-surface`, and\naccessible SVG. `initialWidth` controls responsive server geometry. Vue's\n`useId()` provides a stable generated resource prefix when server and browser\nrender the same tree. Keep definitions, formatters, and dimensions\ndeterministic.\n\n## Presentation and rendering\n\n`class` and `style: StyleValue` apply to the outer host. `className` applies to\nthe rendered chart surface. The component disables general attribute\ninheritance; unrelated attributes are not forwarded. It starts with SVG and\ncan compose marks that use `canvasChartRenderer`. Use `renderSvg` to replace\nSVG serialization without replacing the shared host.\n\nExports: `Chart`, `ChartCommonProps`, `ChartPresentationProps`, `ChartProps`,\n`ChartTooltipBodySlotContext`, `ChartDefinition`, and `ChartPoint`.\n\n## Tooltip body composition\n\nUse the `#tooltipBody` scoped slot for Vue-owned content. Render\n`<component :is=\"defaultBody\" />` to retain native rows and swatches. The\nshared host owns focus, placement, portaling, inert transient state, pinning,\nand dismissal; Vue owns the slot lifecycle inside the body target.\n\nSee the [`Chart` reference](./reference/chart.md), [SSR and hydration](../../guides/ssr-and-hydration.md),\nand [Chart Definition API](../../reference/chart-definitions.md).\n"}
